# Cloudflare Pages rewrites.
#
# This site is a single-page app: every route is served by the same index.html
# and the router picks the screen. Without this, opening /products directly - or
# sharing a link to a product - would 404.
#
# Static files are served first, so this only catches paths that match no file.
# The video files under /videos are therefore unaffected.

/*    /index.html   200

# www is not the shop's address, the bare domain is. One address for one shop:
# two working copies is how a link, a share or a search result ends up pointing
# at whichever one was crawled first, and the two are then indexed as different
# pages with the same content.
#
# Redirected rather than blocked. Someone who types www, or follows an old link
# or a WhatsApp message somebody sent, gets the shop - not an error, and not a
# second copy to be confused with the first.
#
# Only the host changes; the path and query are carried across, so a product link
# shared as www.maa-saraswati.com/products/paneer still lands on that product.
https://www.maa-saraswati.com/*   https://maa-saraswati.com/:splat   301

